mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.6em 0.6em 0.6em 0.6em\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Projecting this onto the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"74\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-plane gives us the equation of the circle of radius <mjx-container class=\"