      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "What is the trace in the $xz$-plane of the sphere ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+(z-1)^{2}=2?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the trace in the $xz$-plane, we substitute $y=0$ into the equation of the sphere:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+(0)^{2}+(z-1)^{2}=2 \\\\ {x}^{2}+(z-1)^{2}=2\\end{aligned}\n$$",
